content:
The TX/RX footnotes tie **1.25 Gbps**, **PRBS 2⁷−1**, and **InfiniBand 1X-LX** (same row). The title line **“Infiniband (2.5Gbps)”** does not appear with **1X-LX** or a second spec table, so a 2.5 Gbps mode would be speculative. **LxP-LT12xx** and **LT12xx** are one product family (title vs ordering part pattern), with the same specced point—two modes per your model rule, shared evidence from those footnotes.

